# Nothing here is served or imported by the function, and some of it is large.
# Keeping it out of the upload makes deploys smaller and faster.
results/
data/
jobs/
research/
# paper/ is excluded EXCEPT the PDF, which the /paper.pdf route serves out of
# the one copy this repository keeps rather than a duplicate in public/. The
# exclusion is `paper/*` and not `paper/`: gitignore semantics never descend
# into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a bare `paper/` makes the negation below
# unreachable and vercel.json's includeFiles then has nothing to include. That
# is exactly how the live route 404ed while every local check passed.
paper/*
!paper/kraken.pdf
scripts4/
scripts/
tests/
tests4/
checkpoints/
configs/
*.md
